{"id":"en_my-beast-mates-billion-dollar-mistake","title":"My Beast Mates' Billion-Dollar Mistake","titleEn":"My Beast Mates' Billion-Dollar Mistake","description":"After enduring years of savage monster hunts across the Therian Empire, Emma finally finds herself matched to arrogant beast lords—who promptly demand a divorce. Rather than plead with them, she takes their enormous buyout payments and leaves without looking back. What they fail to grasp is that Emma is far from a fragile human; she carries a deadly power kept carefully hidden. When that strength at last breaks free, the same men who discarded her come to see their rejection as the gravest error they have ever made, and they are prepared to go to any lengths to reclaim her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-beast-mates-billion-dollar-mistake/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-beast-mates-billion-dollar-mistake/en_US/b468ba67b12b9746/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Sci-Fi","Romance","Female","Sweetness","Future","Science Ficition"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfgq2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-beast-mates-billion-dollar-mistake_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfgq2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-beast-mates-billion-dollar-mistake_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfgq2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-beast-mates-billion-dollar-mistake_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfgq2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-b